@startuml binding_step_4_events
title Step 4: Implement Event Data Path

participant "Provider\nSkeletonEvent<T>" as provider
participant "Binding storage" as storage
participant "Binding control" as control
participant "Consumer\nProxyEvent<T>" as consumer

provider -> storage : Allocate()
storage --> provider : writable sample memory
provider -> storage : write T
provider -> control : Send()/publish slot
control --> consumer : notification or poll-visible state
consumer -> control : GetNewSamples()
control --> consumer : sample handle
consumer -> storage : read sample

note over storage
Zero-copy binding returns memory
handles, not copied payloads.
Reference tracking keeps slot alive.
end note
@enduml
